  "contentPlaintext": "<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"28pt\">WEEKLY PROGRESS REPORT</textStyle></bold>\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"25pt\">Project Title:</textStyle></bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"25pt\"> [Insert Project System Name]</textStyle>\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"25pt\">Academic Reporting Period:</textStyle></bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"25pt\"> Week [01–16]</textStyle>\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"25pt\">Document Version:</textStyle></bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"25pt\"> 1.0.0-Submitted</textStyle>\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"25pt\">Date of Submission:</textStyle></bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"25pt\"> May 28, 2026</textStyle>\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"25pt\">Faculty / Department:</textStyle></bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"25pt\"> Computer Engineering & Computer Science Department</textStyle>\n<bold>Team Attestation & Verification</bold>\nName\nWorkspace Role\nWeekly Contribution Hours\nSignature\n<italic>[Student 1]</italic>\nProject Lead (Manager)\n[e.g., 12 Hours]\n____________\n<italic>[Student 2]</italic>\nStudent (Member)\n[e.g., 15 Hours]\n____________\n<italic>[Student 3]</italic>\nStudent (Member)\n[e.g., 10 Hours]\n____________\n<italic>[Student 4]</italic>\nStudent (Member)\n[e.g., 14 Hours]\n____________\n<italic>[Student 5]</italic>\nStudent (Member)\n[e.g., 11 Hours]\n____________\n<bold>1. Table of Contents</bold>\n1. Table of Contents\n2. Executive Status Summary\n2.1 Macro Health Matrix\n2.2 Key Accomplishments (Current Week)\n3. Task Burndown & Development Metrics\n3.1 Task Execution Details\n3.2 Resource Contribution Variance\n4. Impediments, Blocks & Risk Matrix\n4.1 Active Project Roadblocks\n4.2 Strategy Adjustments\n5. Targeted Goals & Action Items (Next Week)\n5.1 Scheduled Deliverables Plan\n<bold>2. Executive Status Summary</bold>\n<bold>2.1 Macro Health Matrix</bold>\n<bold>Overall Project Status:</bold> [ ] GREEN (On Track) | [ ] YELLOW (At Risk) | [ ] RED (Critical Block)\n<bold>Schedule Variance:</bold> [e.g., 0 Days / -3 Days Behind Timeline]\n<bold>Codebase Test Coverage:</bold> [e.g., 84.2% Passed]\n<bold>Next Faculty Milestone:</bold> [e.g., System Design Document (RDD) Submission]\n<bold>Milestone Target Date:</bold> [Insert Date]\n<bold>2.2 Key Accomplishments (Current Week)</bold>\n<bold>Architecture & Engineering:</bold> Completed integration of the JWT authentication interceptor layer with the secure API routing gateway (<code>FR-UMA-002</code>).\n<bold>Data Tier Configuration:</bold> Initialized physical database migrations for the account validation schema on local Docker development containers.\n<bold>Quality Assurance & Testing:</bold> Wrote and baselined automated failure threshold test scripts (<code>TST-SEC-01</code>) within the test environment suite.\n<bold>3. Task Burndown & Development Metrics</bold>\n<bold>3.1 Task Execution Details</bold>\nThis table tracks active engineering items on the team task board during this reporting period:\nTask Identifier\nTitle / Functional Area\nAssigned Owner\nTaxonomy Tag\nStatus Profile\n<bold>TSK-UMA-402</bold>\nConfigure PBKDF2 Hashing Matrix\n[Student 3]\n<code>implementation</code>\n[x] 100% Closed\n<bold>TSK-SEC-091</bold>\nDraft Error Threshold Tests\n[Student 4]\n<code>deliverable</code>\n[x] 100% Closed\n<bold>TSK-DPE-104</bold>\nBenchmark Latency Traces\n[Student 2]\n<code>research</code>\n[/] 50% In Progress\n<bold>TSK-UI-201</bold>\nConvert Navigation UI Frames\n[Student 5]\n<code>implementation</code>\n[ ] 0% Blocked\n<bold>3.2 Resource Contribution Variance</bold>\n<bold>Project Target Burn Rate:</bold> 60 cumulative team hours per week.\n<bold>Actual Logged Hours:</bold> [Insert Total Hours] hours this period.\n<bold>Variance Explanation:</bold> [If actual hours fall below or exceed targets by more than 15%, document the exact engineering reasons here.]\n<bold>4. Impediments, Blocks & Risk Matrix</bold>\n<bold>4.1 Active Project Roadblocks</bold>\n<bold>4.1.1 UI Route Loading Latency (TSK-UI-201)</bold>\n<bold>Impact:</bold> Major. Client view frame swaps experience page freezing during local simulation loops.\n<bold>Root Cause Analysis:</bold> Component rendering loops trigger duplicate API fetches to backend development nodes.\n<bold>Corrective Action Plan:</bold> [Student 5] is re-architecting client data persistence layers to preserve lookups locally.\n<bold>4.1.2 Deployment Credentials Access</bold>\n<bold>Impact:</bold> Minor. Automated staging deployments are paused.\n<bold>Root Cause Analysis:</bold> Awaiting official staging server security tokens from the faculty infrastructure administrator.\n<bold>Corrective Action Plan:</bold> Project Lead to follow up with the Teaching Assistant via office hours on [Insert Date].\n<bold>4.2 Strategy Adjustments</bold>\nTo recover schedule buffers impacted by local latency debugging, the team has re-allocated three low-priority research tasks to the next sprint. This keeps all technical efforts focused entirely on passing the upcoming RDD faculty milestone checkpoint.\n<bold>5. Targeted Goals & Action Items (Next Week)</bold>\n<bold>5.1 Scheduled Deliverables Plan</bold>\n<bold>5.1.1 Core Objectives</bold>\n<bold>Objective 1 (Integration):</bold> Resolve UI rendering loop freezes and finalize navigation path connections.\n<bold>Objective 2 (Data Operations):</bold> Execute preliminary stress simulation checks (<code>TST-PER-01</code>) using load infrastructure tools.\n<bold>Objective 3 (Documentation):</bold> Compile and organize architecture diagrams to support formal supervisor submissions.\n<bold>5.1.2 Targeted Assignments Matrix</bold>\nTarget Technical Task\nDesignated Owner\nPriority Level\nTarget Board Tag\nTarget Deadline\nFinalize Navigation Fixes\n[Student 5]\nHigh\n<code>implementation</code>\n[Insert Date]\nRun Load Performance Traces\n[Student 4]\nHigh\n<code>review</code>\n[Insert Date]\nExport Database Schema Models\n[Student 2]\nMedium\n<code>research</code>\n[Insert Date]\n<bold>Propose Next</bold>want to proceed to the ultimate capstone document in your workspace repository: <bold>The Final Project Report</bold> (<code>tpl_doc_academic_final_report_v1</code>).",
